# Metadata tree (recursive engine)

- **Root schema:** `src/schemas/root.schema.ts` defines `MetadataNodeSchema` (discriminated union on `type` + `children` via `z.lazy`).
- **Atom branches:** Per-component node bases live in `src/schemas/atoms/*.schema.ts`; extend the union in `root.schema.ts` when adding a type.
- **Pipeline:** For each node — `MetadataNodeSchema.safeParse` → `sanitizeMetadata` on `props` → render `COMPONENT_MAP[type]` from `src/registry/component-registry.ts` → recurse into `children`. Log validation failures with `logger` only.
- **Actions:** Button behavior uses `ActionRegistry` only; never wire handlers through schema JSON.
